## Article 10. Public nature of court proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article10Openness:
  input involvesStateSecret content YesNo
  input involvesOtherProtectedInfo content YesNo
  input involvesPersonalFamilyLife content YesNo
  input infoAlreadyPublic content YesNo
  output hearingIsOpen content YesNo
  output closedHearingRequired content YesNo
  output anyPersonMayAttend content YesNo
  output photoVideoAllowedWithoutPermission content YesNo
  output broadcastRequiresPermission content YesNo
  output videoConferenceBroadcastMandatory content YesNo

scope Article10Openness:
  label open_default definition hearingIsOpen equals Yes

  label closed_exception exception open_default
  definition hearingIsOpen under condition
    involvesStateSecret = Yes
    or involvesOtherProtectedInfo = Yes
    or involvesPersonalFamilyLife = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label closed_required_exception exception not_closed
  definition closedHearingRequired under condition
    involvesStateSecret = Yes
    or involvesOtherProtectedInfo = Yes
    or involvesPersonalFamilyLife = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_closed definition closedHearingRequired equals No

  label reopened_exception exception closed_required_exception
  definition hearingIsOpen under condition
    infoAlreadyPublic = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label may_attend definition anyPersonMayAttend equals hearingIsOpen

  label photo_video definition photoVideoAllowedWithoutPermission equals hearingIsOpen

  label broadcast_permission definition broadcastRequiresPermission equals Yes

  label videoconf_mandatory definition videoConferenceBroadcastMandatory equals Yes
```

## Article 11. Openness of case information

```catala
declaration scope Article11InformationAccess:
  input isCaseParticipant content YesNo
  input caseDecidedTheirRights content YesNo
  input hearingIsClosed content YesNo
  output canAccessCaseInfo content YesNo
  output canAccessCaseMaterials content YesNo
  output canGetCopies content YesNo
  output personalDataMustBeAnonymized content YesNo

scope Article11InformationAccess:
  label participant_access definition canAccessCaseInfo equals Yes

  label non_participant_materials exception no_materials
  definition canAccessCaseMaterials under condition
    isCaseParticipant = No and caseDecidedTheirRights = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_materials definition canAccessCaseMaterials equals isCaseParticipant

  label copies_access definition canGetCopies equals canAccessCaseMaterials

  label anonymize definition personalDataMustBeAnonymized equals Yes
```
